				\begin{document}$$\:\times\:$$\end{document}108 CFU/mL) and centrifuged at 5000 rcf for 15 min to obtain the pellet. The bacterial pellets were treated with PC at MIC (1.25 µg/mL MEM) and MBC (5 µg/mL MEM) and honey at MIC (20% (v/v)) and MBC (40% (v/v)). The untreated bacterial pellets (NC) were added with 1\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
